      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 10,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "  Fix: (3,).unsqueeze(1) \u2192 (3, 1). Then (3, 4) + (3, 1) broadcasts correctly.",
